        "Microsoft Word is the premier word processing software application utilized across governmental secretariats, public corporations, and private enterprises to create, format, edit, and print official documents. In day-to-day administrative operations, ministerial clerks rely heavily on Microsoft Word to prepare official gazette notifications, government orders (GOs), cabinet memorandums, demi-official (DO) letters, circulars, office memorandums, and departmental meeting minutes. Mastering word processing commands, typographic styling, page setup parameters, and document layout controls is an indispensable skill for clerical staff.",
