        "Organic farming and natural agriculture initiatives are expanding rapidly under the Paramparagat Krishi Vikas Yojana (PKVY), with Dungarpur district becoming a model organic farming district. Promoting solar agricultural pumps under the PM-KUSUM scheme and computerizing Primary Agricultural Credit Societies (PACS) ensure that institutional credit and agricultural inputs reach small and marginal farmers efficiently, driving rural prosperity across Rajasthan."
